machine fork/main
  states
    unchosen
    chosen

  transition goLeft()
    unchosen -> chosen
    guard room/entry `cleared` mark/yes
    assert path/west `cleared` mark/yes
    assert self `state` chosen
    retract self `state`

  transition goRight()
    unchosen -> chosen
    guard room/entry `cleared` mark/yes
    assert path/east `cleared` mark/yes
    assert self `state` chosen
    retract self `state`

